Copyright: 2026 Metasequoia IME contributors
License: GPL-3.0-only

Files: vendor/cargo/*
Copyright: The authors of each crate, as named in its Cargo.toml and license files
License: MIT or Apache-2.0
Comment:
 Most vendored crates are dual-licensed MIT or Apache-2.0; the rest carry
 their own license (among them MPL-2.0, BSD-3-Clause, ISC, Zlib,
 Unicode-3.0) in their own directory, which is copied verbatim into
 rust-crates-NOTICES.txt in the binary package.

Files: vendor/frontend/*
Copyright: The authors of the bundled npm packages
License: MIT
Comment:
 The bundle is built from apps/desktop (GPL-3.0-only) and the npm packages
 pnpm-lock.yaml resolves; frontend-npm-NOTICES.txt beside it carries every
 bundled package's own license and notice files.

Files: vendor/voice-runtime/*
Copyright: Xiaomi Corporation and the sherpa-onnx authors
 Microsoft Corporation (ONNX Runtime)
License: Apache-2.0 and MIT
Comment:
 Prebuilt shared libraries of sherpa-onnx (Apache-2.0) with ONNX Runtime
 (MIT) linked in, as published upstream and pinned by
 resources/voice-runtime.lock.json. ONNX Runtime's third-party notices are
 in platforms/linux/data/licenses/onnxruntime-ThirdPartyNotices.txt.

